Qr.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢ひらがなけやき｣衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobFDhb8h.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢２回目のひな誕祭｣衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobPwbsBE.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobxB4zAE.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢青春ポップコーン｣ライブ衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山口陽世ちゃん本人が描き下ろしたイラストが入ったグッズもいっぱい。\nはるよちゃんのスポーツTシャツは袖部分に、メンバー全員の野キュンが描かれてるの。可愛い🥹⚾️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、他にもグッズ着用写真掲載されているので、下記リンクからチェックしてくださいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"商品一覧ページ | 日向坂46 OFFICIAL GOODS STORE | 【ALL ITEMS】三期生LIVE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Instagram\n@mariemorimoto_official"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.instagram.com/mariemorimoto_official"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこの辺りで失礼させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、またお会いしましょう。"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-s46-43436":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは　　　先週の「くりぃむナンタラ」みていただけましたかー？　ADさんに扮して仕掛け人をさせていただきました😌"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202204/mobRoJTsd.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202204/mobTiJkeu.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202204/mob9HumLM.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Buddiesは気づいたかなー？🙊　　初めこそどきどきしていたのですが、どんどんADさんとしての動きやサポートに徹している自分がい